        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s717",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · We have 6 cats and have tried many dif…",
            "text": "We have 6 cats and have tried many different litter brands. We either dealt with litter that couldn’t withstand all 6 cats or was way too expensive to buy monthly for all 6 of them. When we came across catalyst we were skeptical at first but eventually we figured “why not”. And we’ll never turn back. It’s light weight but all powerful. Their scoop makes it so much easier to keep the boxes completely clean. The price is so reasonable especially with having 6 cats. It absorbs their pee like no other and there is no smell. They don’t seem to track litter on their paws nearly as much. We love this litter.",
